all the infiltrators in Spain.


01:07:22.267 --> 01:07:23.859
Luis Angel Barreda.


01:07:24.387 --> 01:07:26.742
He's just reading random names
to save his skin.


01:07:26.947 --> 01:07:29.381
-Doesn't Carlos realize?
-Sara Castilla.


01:07:31.587 --> 01:07:33.020
We'll tell him tomorrow.


01:07:33.227 --> 01:07:34.376
Rodrigo Loro.


01:07:34.547 --> 01:07:37.380
-Tell him what?
-I said we'll drive there tomorrow.


01:07:37.787 --> 01:07:40.347
-What will we tell him?
-The truth.


01:07:40.507 --> 01:07:42.065
Maria Chau.


01:07:42.667 --> 01:07:44.225
What truth?


01:07:44.547 --> 01:07:48.176
That we haven't been infiltrated,
we've been lying and I cheated on him.


01:07:48.387 --> 01:07:50.264
No, hold on a second.


01:07:50.467 --> 01:07:54.255
Julia, you didn't cheat on him.
This was something else.


01:07:56.107 --> 01:07:57.859
Angel Numbella.


01:07:58.067 --> 01:07:59.659
This is more complicated.


01:08:01.747 --> 01:08:03.658
Maria Jose Carballo.


01:08:04.107 --> 01:08:06.985
You want to tell him everything?


01:08:07.187 --> 01:08:08.779
Eduardo Valdivia.


01:08:08.987 --> 01:08:10.579
Okay, that's good.


01:08:13.827 --> 01:08:15.419
Where's Angel?


01:08:21.587 --> 01:08:23.817
I left him at the...
Him too?


01:08:24.707 --> 01:08:27.744
-We'll do Galicia tomorrow at noon.
- But why?


01:08:27.907 --> 01:08:29.260
Please write down


01:08:29.427 --> 01:08:33.102
all the names on the list and share them
with as many people as you can.


01:08:33.867 --> 01:08:35.300
We have to stop this.


01:08:35.467 --> 01:08:38.504
If you know any of the people
mentioned,


01:08:38.707 --> 01:08:40.937
take the necessary measures.


01:08:42.867 --> 01:08:44.744
This is off, right?


01:08:45.147 --> 01:08:46.705
Okay, then.


01:08:48.267 --> 01:08:49.541
-Do you smoke?
-No.


01:08:49.707 --> 01:08:50.901
What about you guys?


01:08:55.347 --> 01:08:57.702
Don't worry, he'll understand.


01:09:12.987 --> 01:09:14.579
I'll go get...


01:10:11.707 --> 01:10:16.178
It's funny how your colleagues
gave you up so quickly.


01:10:16.347 --> 01:10:17.939
They practically thanked me.


01:10:18.147 --> 01:10:22.140
And how quick you were to confess.
Don't think I'm not aware of it.


01:10:23.147 --> 01:10:25.661
I'll feel better
when my friends get here.


01:10:26.307 --> 01:10:29.504
If you're holding anything back
we'll get it out of you.


01:10:30.547 --> 01:10:32.424
She's as sharp as they get.


01:10:33.347 --> 01:10:36.578
Did I tell you she spotted
one of your kind right away?


01:10:37.747 --> 01:10:40.944
The day the ships came
she didn't even leave her apartment.


01:10:41.787 --> 01:10:45.257
Only to help some stranger
in the street. How about that?


01:10:45.907 --> 01:10:48.296
She's the person I admire most.


01:10:48.467 --> 01:10:51.345
What sucks is I'm telling you this
instead of her.


01:10:51.547 --> 01:10:54.061
I don't think I've ever told her.


01:10:54.427 --> 01:10:57.942
It's the first thing I'll tell her
in the morning.


01:12:02.587 --> 01:12:05.784
Julia wants to talk to you.
We both do.


01:12:06.187 --> 01:12:07.097
What?


01:12:07.347 --> 01:12:08.939
We're going home.


01:12:09.227 --> 01:12:11.616
You can go back to your apartment.


01:12:15.107 --> 01:12:16.825
What do you want to tell me?


01:12:17.307 --> 01:12:19.502
We owe you an apology.


01:12:20.707 --> 01:12:22.937
Out of nowhere?
What happened?


01:12:26.067 --> 01:12:27.500
What happened?


01:12:29.347 --> 01:12:30.746
What happened?


01:12:31.147 --> 01:12:32.546
What happened?


01:12:43.747 --> 01:12:46.307
Don't tell me.
You screwed things up good, huh?


01:12:46.427 --> 01:12:48.816
Did Carlos catch you two humping?


01:12:49.027 --> 01:12:50.619
This is going to be good.


01:12:50.827 --> 01:12:52.146
That's it, right?


01:12:52.587 --> 01:12:54.657
Is that it? Is that it?


01:12:54.867 --> 01:12:55.982
Is that it?


01:13:12.307 --> 01:13:14.218
Hey, you're going the wrong way...


01:13:14.387 --> 01:13:16.901
We're going somewhere
you won't bother us.


01:13:18.187 --> 01:13:19.779
But didn't you say Julia...


01:13:19.987 --> 01:13:23.184
I'll tell Julia I came here,
you got away,


01:13:23.347 --> 01:13:26.498
I looked everywhere
and couldn't find you. Period.


01:13:28.907 --> 01:13:30.056
What about Carlos?


01:13:30.387 --> 01:13:32.503
Carlos, Carlos, Carlos!


01:13:32.827 --> 01:13:34.385
Fuck Carlos!


01:13:36.587 --> 01:13:38.498
Carlos has nothing to do with this.


01:13:39.827 --> 01:13:43.183
I'm fucking in charge here
and I've had enough of you.


01:13:44.827 --> 01:13:45.737
Shit.


01:14:16.907 --> 01:14:18.465
The military has fenced off


01:14:18.667 --> 01:14:20.544
the area right under the ship.


01:14:21.107 --> 01:14:23.223
Apparently people have seen
some weird stuff out there.


01:14:24.827 --> 01:14:26.704
I don't mean to scare you, but...


01:14:26.947 --> 01:14:27.857
maybe they're already


01:14:28.067 --> 01:14:30.706
doing something but in a way


01:14:30.947 --> 01:14:32.266
we don't realize.


01:14:36.107 --> 01:14:37.017
Maybe


01:14:37.227 --> 01:14:40.424
they can fit in among us
without us realizing.


01:14:41.307 --> 01:14:42.296
Shit!


01:15:03.907 --> 01:15:05.499
What was I saying?


01:15:06.627 --> 01:15:08.219
I was saying something.


01:15:10.387 --> 01:15:11.376
Angel.


01:15:12.147 --> 01:15:14.058
I'm sorry.
Please, forgive me.


01:15:15.067 --> 01:15:15.977
What?


01:15:16.587 --> 01:15:18.179
I didn't know...


01:15:19.747 --> 01:15:22.022
-I didn't know...
-You didn't know what?


01:15:24.147 --> 01:15:26.980
Please, let me go.
I'm begging you.


01:15:27.227 --> 01:15:29.616
You'll never see me again.
I'll leave Madrid.


01:15:29.827 --> 01:15:32.022
I've got a house in Cantabria.
I'll disappear.


01:15:32.187 --> 01:15:34.223
Please, let me out of the car.


01:15:35.147 --> 01:15:37.377
I won't tell anybody that you're a...


01:15:37.587 --> 01:15:39.020
that you're a...


01:15:39.187 --> 01:15:40.620
Well, you know.


01:16:06.827 --> 01:16:09.057
-You're untied.
-What?


01:16:10.947 --> 01:16:12.824
I didn't realize.


01:16:26.987 --> 01:16:27.897
Here.


01:16:31.427 --> 01:16:32.337
Anyway...


01:16:32.587 --> 01:16:34.464
-You're leaving, right?
-Yeah.


01:16:35.747 --> 01:16:37.180
You won't hurt me, right?


01:16:38.147 --> 01:16:39.375
No.


01:16:41.747 --> 01:16:44.022
Actually I'm thankful.


01:16:44.827 --> 01:16:45.942
Why is that?


01:16:47.387 --> 01:16:50.902
Because I've tried to get out
of this situation before and...


01:16:51.347 --> 01:16:52.905
it's really tough.


01:16:54.227 --> 01:16:55.342
What is?


01:16:57.387 --> 01:17:00.220
Not having the balls to leave
when you know for sure


01:17:00.387 --> 01:17:01.979
nobody wants you.


01:17:08.867 --> 01:17:09.982
Right...


01:17:12.827 --> 01:17:14.101
Here, take this.


01:17:14.267 --> 01:17:15.495
I don't want it.


01:17:24.587 --> 01:17:25.497
That means...


01:17:28.627 --> 01:17:31.824
everything you've done...
you did it all for her?


01:17:37.867 --> 01:17:38.982
Yeah.


01:17:40.347 --> 01:17:41.462
Like you.


01:17:43.267 --> 01:17:45.656
Yeah, but there's no comparison...


01:19:46.707 --> 01:19:48.140
Hi, it's me.


01:19:52.427 --> 01:19:56.898
Sorry, I set this up
because I didn't want to wake you.


01:19:59.307 --> 01:20:01.662
I understand you wanting
to come clean about everything


01:20:01.907 --> 01:20:03.818
and tell everybody, okay?


01:20:04.467 --> 01:20:06.583
But I don't know...


01:20:07.507 --> 01:20:09.384
I was thinking...


01:20:09.787 --> 01:20:12.859
and I came up with one more lie.


01:21:51.667 --> 01:21:52.577
Freeze!


01:22:05.467 --> 01:22:06.377
Hi.


01:22:09.387 --> 01:22:11.025
What were you doing in there?


01:22:12.427 --> 01:22:13.416
I...


01:22:16.387 --> 01:22:17.502
I'm sorry.


01:22:18.947 --> 01:22:21.222
What are you sorry about?


01:22:22.307 --> 01:22:24.377
-Where's Julia?
-She's fine, at her place.


01:22:25.107 --> 01:22:25.857
But...


01:22:26.067 --> 01:22:27.216
Carlos.


01:22:29.627 --> 01:22:31.857
I came to apologize.


01:22:33.907 --> 01:22:35.056
Apologize?


01:22:37.107 --> 01:22:39.018
For actually being a...


01:22:41.627 --> 01:22:42.742
You know.


01:22:48.067 --> 01:22:50.581
I promise you I meant well.


01:22:50.987 --> 01:22:53.262
I was gonna leave, take my...


01:22:53.787 --> 01:22:55.664
machine and leave.


01:23:00.267 --> 01:23:02.098
You wouldn't let me, remember?


01:23:03.147 --> 01:23:04.705
But after that I thought,


01:23:04.907 --> 01:23:08.377
''You'll never be this close again.''


01:23:08.587 --> 01:23:11.420
You know how boring
my life is up there?


01:23:11.627 --> 01:23:13.219
Wait, wait, wait!


01:23:14.187 --> 01:23:16.382
That thing over there is yours?


01:23:17.027 --> 01:23:18.016
Yeah.


01:23:20.387 --> 01:23:21.137
I saw it.


01:23:21.347 --> 01:23:25.135
It drove right past. I described it
and this looks a lot like it.


01:23:26.067 --> 01:23:27.659
That weird car Julia saw,
the one you drew...


01:23:27.867 --> 01:23:28.617
Yeah.


01:23:28.827 --> 01:23:31.136
Maybe he came in it
and he's got it parked somewhere.


01:23:31.307 --> 01:23:34.026
-There are some swings over there.
-Yeah.


01:23:34.227 --> 01:23:35.660
You couldn't pay me
to go over there.


01:23:35.867 --> 01:23:38.097
You had it parked by the swings.


01:23:41.387 --> 01:23:42.945
-Son of a bitch!
-Carlos!


01:23:44.187 --> 01:23:47.065
What I'm most sorry about
is you leaving.


01:23:47.307 --> 01:23:49.184
Actually, we got rid of you.


01:23:49.387 --> 01:23:51.298
It was me, Julia was against it.


01:23:51.467 --> 01:23:54.504
I bolted the door and convinced her
not to open it.


01:23:54.707 --> 01:23:55.822
But why?


01:23:57.347 --> 01:23:58.905
Your notes, Carlos.


01:23:59.307 --> 01:24:01.218
Your books, all that information.


01:24:01.387 --> 01:24:04.584
I was dying to get my hands on it
without raising suspicion.


01:24:04.787 --> 01:24:06.823
I was sick and tired of pretending.


01:24:09.667 --> 01:24:11.544
-That's why you did it?
-I swear.


01:24:13.227 --> 01:24:14.785
That's why you kept it.


01:24:14.987 --> 01:24:15.897
That's right.


01:24:16.987 --> 01:24:20.024
And that's why you didn't care
if I demolished your building.


01:24:21.907 --> 01:24:23.499
You gave me a random address.


01:24:23.707 --> 01:24:24.822
Exactly.


01:24:27.987 --> 01:24:30.376
I only wanted to learn about you.


01:24:30.587 --> 01:24:33.021
When I go back they probably
won't even ask what I did.


01:24:33.187 --> 01:24:36.065
They might not even know I came down.
Almost nobody does.


01:24:36.787 --> 01:24:37.537
No?


01:24:39.467 --> 01:24:42.345
Well, maybe to take a stroll,


01:24:42.587 --> 01:24:46.626
like I was doing when I blacked out.
But hardly anyone.


01:24:49.187 --> 01:24:53.385
Do the ones on the ship know
what I've been saying on TV?


01:24:54.147 --> 01:24:56.980
If the guy on TV were one of us


01:24:57.187 --> 01:25:00.259
they would have rescued him.
They don't give a shit.


01:25:03.187 --> 01:25:04.176
Damn.


01:25:04.987 --> 01:25:07.501
What I did to that poor guy...


01:25:08.747 --> 01:25:10.339
I've got him there.


01:25:13.507 --> 01:25:15.384
Why did you leave the apartment?


01:25:17.747 --> 01:25:20.580
Julia realized you were one of them,
didn't she?


01:25:25.667 --> 01:25:28.864
Actually she never believed
you were one of us.


01:25:33.267 --> 01:25:34.666
Is she by herself right now?


01:25:39.067 --> 01:25:40.386
Then there was Angel...


01:25:40.587 --> 01:25:42.862
I don't wanna hear about that jerk.


01:25:44.947 --> 01:25:47.177
Here, let me. I'll handle it.


01:25:47.347 --> 01:25:49.099
-This is the key?
-Yeah.


01:25:49.307 --> 01:25:52.185
He's in a small room by the set.


01:25:54.507 --> 01:25:56.259
I'll clear things up for him.


01:26:06.747 --> 01:26:07.384
Hey!


01:26:10.427 --> 01:26:12.224
Why are you here?


01:26:15.427 --> 01:26:17.657
Yeah, with the ships and all that.


01:26:20.187 --> 01:26:21.745
There's no reason.


01:26:24.587 --> 01:26:25.576
What?


01:26:26.147 --> 01:26:28.536
You came for the hell of it?


01:26:31.827 --> 01:26:34.660
We extraterrestrials are like that.


01:26:46.787 --> 01:26:48.379
If my plan works,


01:26:48.587 --> 01:26:50.782
Carlos will be back anytime.


01:26:51.467 --> 01:26:53.378
So erase this tape right away.


01:26:55.827 --> 01:26:56.816
And that's all.


01:26:57.227 --> 01:26:59.616
Actually, it's not.


01:27:00.307 --> 01:27:02.184
There's something
I want to tell you.


01:27:03.467 --> 01:27:04.741
I came close to saying it


01:27:04.947 --> 01:27:08.622
many times but I thought
it might sound too...


01:27:09.347 --> 01:27:10.462
forced,


01:27:11.507 --> 01:27:13.304
too untimely,


01:27:17.067 --> 01:27:18.625
too fake.


01:27:20.067 --> 01:27:23.537
I'm not saying it won't sound fake now,
but I have to say it.


01:27:28.587 --> 01:27:29.702
I love you.


01:27:38.587 --> 01:27:40.225
How did you tape it?


01:27:40.387 --> 01:27:41.945
What do you mean?


01:27:42.827 --> 01:27:45.705
In a single shot or did you edit it?


01:27:47.347 --> 01:27:50.817
A single shot.
I turned on the camera and said it.


01:27:52.587 --> 01:27:54.976
You didn't write it down first?


01:27:55.227 --> 01:27:57.457
It just came out?


01:27:57.707 --> 01:27:58.822
Yeah.


01:27:59.707 --> 01:28:01.584
It's not so hard, is it?


01:28:11.667 --> 01:28:14.898
If I don't have it on paper
in front of me...


01:28:15.107 --> 01:28:16.984
I butcher it every time.

